        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, binu nibyo MUKAMA arukugambaho omukama w'Asiriya ati: “Orubuga runu talirutaaha, talirurasamu omusogi talirwirra haihi, akwasire engabu, talirugota naarwombekaho ekisiika eky'itaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuhanda ogwamuleesire, nugwo gulimugarrayo, kandi MUKAMA naagamba ngu: orubuga runu talirutaaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba, ndirurwanirra ndujune, habwange na habw'omwiru wange Daudi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
