          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika wa MUKAMA, akagenda yaita omu rusiisira rw'Abasiriya abantu emitwaro ikumi na munaana, n'enkumi itaano; abantu obu bairukire nyenkyakara, bakasanga abantu abo boona bafiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Senakaribbu omukama w'Asiriya kurugayo yataaha, yaikara Nineeve. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kimu, obu akaba naaramya omunju ya Nisirooki embandwa ye, Aduramereki na Saraza batabani be baamwisa ekitara, baayekwatira omuhanda ogutwara omunsi Ararati. Omutabani Esarahadoni, yateera engoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
